From f4333d23ea3ad5fba0af38918341ea2c5b25f990 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 09:10:21 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 01/32] landingpage: new Home page with common tasks and
 all-settings cards

Top to bottom: Common tasks (wrapping grid, one click to the page), the
existing Quick Settings (theme, animation speed, click behaviour, most used
pages) unchanged, then All settings: a card per category under its group.
Data comes from ia/layout.json via scripts/gen_home.py into homedata_p.h
(kli18nc strings, extracted by Messages.sh; .h files added to the xgettext
list). Only pages whose KCM is installed are shown; a card opens the first
installed page of its category. Pages open through the existing openKCM()
(systemsettings is a unique instance, so it just switches page).

Speed (P15): the plugin scan runs after the first frame (Timer), theme
previews load with asynchronous: true. Bench (weston pixman, fast, 3 rounds,
page switch): frame 151-157 ms before, 168-173 ms after; ready 178-185 ms
before, 192-202 ms after (the page now holds ~24 more items).

Keyboard: each grid is one Tab stop, arrows move inside, Return/Space open;
every item has an accessible name (and description for cards).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X5N5x9eWzmrq6QYrYLwQnk
